# shell: desktop
# TS-058: the preferences window, its pages, and apply-immediately.
note Ctrl+comma opens it, whatever is focused
key comma ctrl
wait 5
expect-title preferences
note clicking a checkbox applies at once and saves -- there is no OK button
click 435 208
wait 5
expect-file /tmp/trk_home/.config/TrackerSettings
note and switching page shows that page's controls
click 350 232
wait 3
shot /tmp/trk_script/prefs.png
quit
